{c: Verse 1}
[C]jaana suno, [A#]hum tumpe [C]marte hai
[C]tumse [A#]mo-habbat [C]karte hai
[C]Chahat [A#]me-re haseen, [C]Koi [A#]Gu-nah naheen
[C]yEh jo [A#]mo-habbat hai, [C]yehi to [A#]ee-badat hai
[C]To fir [A#]aooo, pyaar [C]mein jala-ye dil
